2026-10-26  Tonino Cosentino  <tonino.cosentino@gmx.de>

	Analysis of cold days per year in Uppsala 1722-2022

	* macros/coldDays.C: New ROOT macro. Counts the days with a daily
	mean temperature below 0 C per year, fits a straight line and draws
	a 31-year moving average. The plot is saved in figures/coldDays.png.

2026-10-23  Tonino Cosentino  <tonino.cosentino@gmx.de>

	Cleaning of the Uppsala 1722-2022 dataset

	* scripts/clean_data.sh: Remove the Windows line endings from
	uppsala_tm_1722-2022.dat and check for implausible values.

2026-10-22  Tonino Cosentino  <tonino.cosentino@gmx.de>

	Fix of the SMHI data cleaning script

	* scripts/clean_data.sh: Find the "Datum" header line in every file
	instead of skipping a fixed number of lines. Extract datasets.tgz,
	create the output folders and add a plausibility check (-55 to +40 C).